{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13232030","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13232030","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1323203001:1":{"text":"欢迎光临！几位吃点什么？","source_cn":"欢迎光临！几位吃点什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x306CFC6D590FE476","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1323203001":{"text":"欢迎光临！几位吃点什么？","source_cn":"欢迎光临！几位吃点什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x306CFC6D590FE476","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1323203004:1":{"text":"我想我知道你说的是谁了。","source_cn":"我想我知道你说的是谁了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA89D0BBD609BD7F5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"我想我知道你说的是谁了。","female":"我想我知道你说的是谁了。","variant_male_record_index":"155123","variant_female_record_index":"155124","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1323203005:1":{"text":"你要的是这瓶吧，寒冬之吻。","source_cn":"你要的是这瓶吧，寒冬之吻。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1260B94A45815032","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"你要的是这瓶吧，寒冬之吻。","female":"你要的是这瓶吧，寒冬之吻。","variant_male_record_index":"155125","variant_female_record_index":"155126","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:5::0":{"text":"寒冬之吻","source_cn":"寒冬之吻","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E6FC84DB45B9580","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1323203006:1":{"text":"老板娘居然一下就猜到了！好厉害！","source_cn":"老板娘居然一下就猜到了！好厉害！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9436ED18C61A81C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1323203007:1":{"text":"当然，来过餐馆的每一位顾客我都有印象。","source_cn":"当然，来过餐馆的每一位顾客我都有印象。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8AC301BB2C8B74C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1323203008:1":{"text":"那个谢尔盖，常来我这里买寒冬之吻，据他所说是为了钓鱼，他还是第一个会给鱼喝酒的。","source_cn":"那个谢尔盖，常来我这里买寒冬之吻，据他所说是为了钓鱼，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BED5527C919317C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1323203009:1":{"text":"那些鱼估计还以为是大自然的馈赠呢，然后找遍白山的所有河都没有再找到那天的味道，直到这个男人又带酒来了。","source_cn":"那些鱼估计还以为是大自然的馈赠呢，然后找遍白山的所有河...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6513D76807170880","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1323203010:1":{"text":"这两瓶都给他带去吧，不用替他付钱，我会亲自划在他的账上。","source_cn":"这两瓶都给他带去吧，不用替他付钱，我会亲自划在他的账上。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA143FC52E6B7CB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:0:1":